OL,3,ADept Q crew member dies after being
OL,4,Ainjured at Edinburgh film studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the crew for the Netflix
OL,7,Fseries Dept Q has died after being
OL,8,Fseriously injured at a film studio in
OL,9,FEdinburgh.
OL,11,FEmergency crews were called to
OL,12,FFirstStage studio in Leith at about
OL,13,F15:00 on Thursday and the man was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,16,FLeft Bank Pictures, which is involved
OL,17,Fin making Dept Q, later said it was
OL,18,F"shocked and saddened" by the death of
OL,19,Fa crew member.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
