OL,3,ADept Q crew member dies after being
OL,4,Ainjured at Edinburgh film studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said the death was not
OL,7,Fbeing treated as suspicious but
OL,8,Finquiries into the circumstances were
OL,9,Fongoing. The Health and Safety
OL,10,FExecutive said it was "aware" of the
OL,11,Fincident.
